    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes discrete profile data collected during the R/V Sarmiento de Gamboa HOTMIX cruise (EXPOCODE 29AH20140426) in Mediterranean Sea and Atlantic Ocean from 2014-04-26 to 2014-05-31. These data include dissolved inorganic carbon (DIC), total alkalinity, pH on total scale at 25\u00c2\u00baC, chlorofluorocarbon 12 (CFC-12), sulfur hexaflouride (SF6), temperature, salinity, dissolved oxygen, silicate, nitrate+nitrite and phosphate.",
